From: blester <blester@oreon>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] TST: numexpr 2.13.1 no longer warns on bool +/*

numexpr 2.13.1 does bool +/*. tests should only expect the fallback
UserWarning on older numexpr. same idea as later pandas 2.3.x.

